  },
  {
   "root_cause": "inference",
   "what": "missed the 808/bounce build (~585-610s, 'I added another 808') and the hat rolls (~933s) \u2014 over-aggressive talk-only classification after the empty-ops fix",
   "lesson": "a step that names a concrete addition ('I added X', 'grab a hat, drag it out') is a build step even inside an explanation"
  },
  {
   "root_cause": "inference",
   "what": "single-track pitch-lane drums diverged from the screen's 4-channel rack; duplicate set_tempo re-emitted; notes beyond clip length",
   "lesson": "mirror the visible channel structure (one track per rack channel); never re-emit ops in the session summary; notes must fit the clip"
  },
  {
   "root_cause": "vocabulary",
   "what": "FL wrench-tool micro-delay (systematic late nudge of selected notes) has no IR op; approximated with seeded humanize",
   "lesson": "IR v0.2 candidate: notes.nudge {clip_id, selector, offset_beats}"
  },
  {
   "root_cause": "policy",
   "what": "duplicated vision claims saturated L2 (0.958) and the L2-only rule crowned a near-empty build gold",
   "lesson": "dedupe (kind,value) claims; gold requires L2>=0.8 AND judge>=4 (both shipped)"
  },
  {
   "root_cause": "vocabulary",
   "what": "samplers had no sounds \u2014 the replication was structurally right and SILENT (Emilio's listen test failed at hello)",
   "lesson": "IR v0.2 promoted early per s14.5: device.load_sound (asset->sampler binding) \u2014 audibility is part of correctness; rescore now flags silent bounces"
