  {
   "root_cause": "claims",
   "what": "CLAP text->one-shot ranking is noisy on transients (a water-drop perc outranked real claps for 'rnb clap')",
   "lesson": "use CLAP as a tiebreak over token+pack-context prefiltering, not as the oracle; resolver scores the full crate path, not just filenames"
